ists of watercolor drawings measuring 9x5 cm. This animation was created in 2019 as part of a personal exhibition (Movement) in the Artsvit gallery (Dnipro). In 2020, the festival premiere of this movie took place at the Linoleum festival. In 2022, “Imaginary Landscape “ won the grand prize in the abstract animation competition at the Anifilm festival (Czech Republic).\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"The abstract film “Imaginary Landscapes “ consists of watercolor drawings measuring 9x5 cm. This animation was created in 2019 as part of a personal exhibition (Movement) in the Artsvit gallery (Dnipro). In 2020, the festival premiere of this movie took place at the Linoleum festival. In 2022, “Imaginary Landscape “ won the grand prize in the abstract animation competition at the Anifilm festival (Czech Republic).\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"http://nikitaliskov.com/abstract-films/imaginary-landscapes\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"http://nikitaliskov.com/abstract-films/imaginary-landscapes\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Nikita Liskov’s Home Site\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2021-11-01T00:00:00+02:00\" />\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BlogPosting\",\"headline\":\"Imaginary Landscapes\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Nikita Liskov\"},\"datePublished\":\"2021-11-01T00:00:00+02:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2021-11-01T00:00:00+02:00\",\"description\":\"The abstract film “Imaginary Landscapes “ consists of watercolor drawings measuring 9x5 cm. This animation was created in 2019 as part of a personal exhibition (Movement) in the Artsvit gallery (Dnipro). In 2020, the festival premiere of this movie took place at the Linoleum festival. In 2022, “Imaginary Landscape “ won the grand prize in the abstract animation competition at the Anifilm festival (Czech Republic).\",\"publisher\"