ilms\">\n        \n\n        <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bJ1t-cyqpsw\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe>\n\n        \n\n        \n        <div class=\"text\">\n            <div>\n                <strong>\n                    \n                    Kyiv Cake\n                    \n                </strong>\n            </div>\n            <pre>\"Kyiv Cake\" - studio Joonisfilm. \n15 min, 2D, 16x9, color\n\nThe events of the movie unfold in modern Ukraine.  \nA child is born into a poor family, the parents do everything possible to survive, \nbut just when the crisis reaches its peak, a new danger flares up.  \n\nScript Author: Mykyta Lyskov  \nDirector and Art Director: Mykyta Lyskov  \nComposer: Anton Baibakov  \nComposite: Mykyta Lyskov  \nAnimator: Aili Allas, Tarmo Vaarmets, Mykyta Lyskov, Shara Arus  \nSound Design: Horret Kuus  \nEditor: Mykyta Lyskov  \nProducer: Kalev Tamm  \n\n© Eesti Joonisfilm  \n</pre>\n        </div>\n        \n\n        \n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Regular page -->\n\n\n<script src=\"/assets/js/media_wrapper.js\"></script>\n\n        </div>\n        <!-- see disqus in main_content -->\n      </div>\n  </div>\n  \n</div>\n\n<!-- Javascript for collapsing/expanding the menu -->\n<script src=\"/assets/js/lib/underscore.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"/assets/js/lib/jquery.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"/assets/js/lib/animqueue.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"/assets/js/common.js\"></script>\n\n<!-- Snow effect on site -->\n<!-- <script src=\"/assets/js/lib/snowstormv144_20131208/snowstorm.js\"></script> -->\n\n<!-- Google analytics -->\n<script>\n  (function(i,s,o,g,r,a,m){i['GoogleAnalyticsObject']=r;i[r]=i[r]||function(){\n  (i[r].q=i[r].q||[]).push(arguments)},i[r].l=1*new Date();a=s.createElement(o),\n  m=s.getElementsByTagName(o)[0];a.async=1;a.src=g;m.parentNode.insertBefore(a,m)\n  })(window,document,'script','//www.google-analytics.com/analytics.js','ga');\n  ga('create', 'UA-68257324-1', 'auto');\n  ga('send', 'pageview');\n</script>\n\n\n\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"path":"animation/_posts/2017-10-31-i-bought-a-bike.md","output":"<!-- HELP: https://shopify.github.io/liquid/basics/types/ -->\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en-us\">\n<head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"content-type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Nikita Liskov (Mykyta Lyskov) official site\" />\n  <meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"Никита Лыськов, Микита Лиськов, Mykyta Lyskov, Nikita Liskov, nikitaliskov, Кохання, deep love, днепр, Дніпро, Dnipro\" />\n  <meta name=\"author\" content=\"Nikita Liskov (Mykyta Lyskov)\" />\n  <title>I bought a bike - N I K I T A&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;L I S K O V</title>\n  <!-- Site theme -->\n  \n\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/assets/css/lib/bootstrap.css\"/>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/assets/css/all.css\"/>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/assets/css/small.css\"/>\n  \n  <!-- Begin Jekyll SEO tag v2.2.3 -->\n<title>I bought a bike | Nikita Liskov’s Home Site</title>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"I bought a bike\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Nikita Liskov\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"[\"en\", \"uk\"]\" />\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"four short stories about life\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"four short stories about life\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"http://nikitaliskov.com/animation/i-bought-a-bike\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"http://nikitaliskov.com/animation/i-bought-a-bike\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Nikita Liskov’s Home Site\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2017-10-31T00:00:00+02:00\" />\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BlogPosting\",\"headline\":\"I bought a bike\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\